The '''Guardian''' is an [[Ascendancy class]] for [[Templar]]s.

==Overview==
[[Image:Ascendancy skill tree Guardian.png|290px|thumb|right|Guardian skill tree]]

The Guardian possesses many defensive skills that affect his [[Ally|allies]], making him suitable for builds dedicated to [[partying]] with other players, or [[minions]]. They can specialise in [[aura]]s to give them bonuses to defences and recovery, provide party-wide bonus [[block]] chance, or apply powerful [[Hallowing Flame]]s. The Guardian also has the ability to summon holy minions exclusive to them: a [[Summon Sentinel of Radiance|Sentinel of Radiance]] that protects the Guardian by taunting enemies and redirecting damage towards it while burning enemies around it, and [[Summon Elemental Relic|Elemental Relics]] that provide the effect of elemental damage auras and explode on death. The Guardian is also able to gain bursts of healing and debuff removal with [[Time of Need]] and gain random [[shrine]] buffs with [[Harmony of Purpose]].

