==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.28.0|
* The Guardian's [[Summon Sentinel of Radiance|Sentinel of Radiance]] Minion no longer has duration (it is a permanent minion) and has approximately 36% more Movement Speed. Note the Sentinel still doesn't persist between areas.
* Effects that grant random Shrine buffs such as Guardian's {{psl|Harmony of Purpose}} Notable or {{il|The Golden Charlatan}} Unique Sword instead now grant Greater Shocking, Freezing and Skeletal Shrine (instead of the regular versions of these Shrines).
* The {{psl|Time of Need}} Notable now has Every 4 seconds, remove Curses and Ailments from you (previously removed Curses and Elemental Ailments).
* The Guardian now has an additional 2-point Ascendancy Notable: [[Marshal of Divinity]]. This Notable grants Inflict [[Hallowing Flame]] on Melee Hit, You can inflict +1 Hallowing Flame on Enemies, and Gain 10% of Physical Damage as Extra Lightning Damage for each of your Hallowing Flames that have been removed by an allied hit recently, up to 80%.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.27.0|
* Shrine Buffs granted by the {{psl|Harmony of Purpose}} Ascendancy Passive Skill now have a base Duration of 20 seconds (previously 10)
}}
{{Version history table row|3.22.0|
* The Guardian Ascendancy has been reworked.
** The minor passive preceding [[Harmony of Purpose]] now grants increased link skill effect and increased armour and energy shield.
** The minor passive preceding [[Bastion of Hope]] no longer grants additional attack block chance. It now grants increased block recovery.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.10.0|
