* Unwavering Crusade: Has been reworked: Now grants nearby allies 30% increased damage, 15% increased attack, cast and movement speed, 30% increased area of effect, and causes nearby allies to [[Intimidate]] and [[Unnerve]] Enemies for 4 seconds on hit.
}}
